    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That’s kind, but it doesn't change reality. The truth is I’ve lost my independence. I can’t even do the simple things without feeling like I'm struggling. It's like I've lost all my agency. I'm just at the mercy of whatever comes next, and I hate that feeling of being helpless. I wish I could just be in charge of things for once.",
